---
// spec: S05 (/board/9th)
import BoardClassPage from '../../components/BoardClassPage.astro';
---
<BoardClassPage
  cls="9th"
  heading="9th class test paper: board pattern"
  intro="Matric part 1 ke liye apne chapters aur number ke mutabiq test paper banwayen."
  subjects={['English', 'Urdu', 'Islamiat', 'Tarjuma-tul-Quran', 'Maths', 'Physics', 'Chemistry', 'Biology', 'Computer Science', 'General Science']}
  faq={[
    { q: '9th mein kaun se chapters dein?', a: 'Jo aap ke school ya academy mein ab tak parhaye gaye hain, ya jin ka test lena hai. Maslan "Chapter 1 se 3".' },
    { q: 'Science aur Arts dono ke papers milte hain?', a: 'Haan. Order mein apna mazmoon likhein, maslan Physics, Biology ya General Science.' },
    { q: 'Kya paper ke jawab bhi milte hain?', a: 'Paper ke sath koi khaas zaroorat ho, maslan answer key, to order ke baad WhatsApp par bata dein; hum bata denge ke kya mumkin hai.' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="paper-heading">9th class ka paper kaisa hota hai</h2>
  <p class="mt-3">
    9th class matric ka pehla saal hai, aur yahin se board ke imtihan ki aadat banti hai. Board ke paper mein aam taur par do hisse
    hote hain: objective, jis mein MCQs hote hain aur waqt kam hota hai, aur subjective, jis mein short sawal aur long sawal hote
    hain. Is liye tayyari mein dono ki practice zaroori hai.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Science group mein Physics, Chemistry aur Biology ya Computer Science ke sath Maths aham hai; in mazameen mein definitions,
    numericals aur diagrams teeno par sawal aate hain. English aur Urdu mein grammar, translation aur comprehension par tawajjo
    chahiye. Islamiat aur Tarjuma-tul-Quran mein yaad karne wala hissa zyada hota hai.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Test paper ka faida yeh hai ke aap asal imtihan jaisa waqt laga kar paper hal karte hain. Pehle chhote hisse, maslan do teen
    chapters, ka paper banwayen. Phir har mahine pichhle chapters ko mila kar bara paper. Is tarah saal ke aakhir tak poora
    syllabus kai dafa dohra liya jata hai.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3">
    Teachers is paper ko class test ke liye istemal kar sakte hain. Order mein mazmoon, chapters aur kul number likhein; class
    pehle se 9th chuni hui hai. Agar aap ka board ka syllabus khaas hai to WhatsApp par bata dein.
  </p>
</BoardClassPage>
